==History==
2024
*The Goblin Barrel’s Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/6/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/6/2024)|June 2024 Update]].
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], changed the Evolved Goblin Barrel's visual effects. The fake barrel will now have a different color for the first second when launched.
*On 8/7/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/7/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Decoy Goblins' damage by 26%.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a balance Update, decreased the Decoy Goblins' damage by 26%.

